{"date":"1988-08-03","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/6e/dc/112420_Sg2Tn.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/6e/dc/112420_Sg2Tn.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/6e/dc/112420_Sg2Tn.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/6e/dc/112420_Sg2Tn.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/6e/dc/112420_Sg2Tn.jpg"},"summary":"　　一日，小女孩爱丽丝（Kristýna Kohoutová 饰）在自己的房间玩耍，一只兔子闯入了她的玻璃橱柜，神色慌张地更衣赶路，爱丽丝跟随这只奇怪的兔子爬进抽屉，很快便从一个大水桶里掉入了另一个世界。然而，这并不是我们从童话里熟知的那个爱丽丝仙境，兔子肚子里竟然填满了木屑，需要吃木屑补充能量，它还有一把专门用来砍头的大剪刀；鱼缸里的鱼骨头会咬人；袜子虫长着假牙钻来钻去……这里的一切与其说是奇幻，不如说是诡怪，甚至有些残酷和肮脏。面对着预料之外的种种威胁，爱丽丝在“仙境”中探索前行，她最终将走到哪里，又将遇到些什么？同时她也在好奇，这个世界和自己的房间，究竟哪个才是现实，哪个才是“仙境”…… \r\n　　本片曾获1989年安纳西国际动画电影节故事片奖。","name":"Něco z Alenky","name_cn":"爱丽丝","tags":[{"name":"剧场版","count":33,"total_count":723086},{"name":"杨·史云梅耶","count":26,"total_count":488},{"name":"欧美","count":26,"total_count":86561},{"name":"定格动画","count":17,"total_count":3222},{"name":"1988","count":13,"total_count":6814},{"name":"JanŠvankmajer","count":11,"total_count":187},{"name":"名著改","count":9,"total_count":110},{"name":"小说改","count":7,"total_count":158842},{"name":"捷克","count":7,"total_count":300},{"name":"电影","count":4,"total_count":13530},{"name":"1980s","count":3,"total_count":1096},{"name":"瑞士","count":3,"total_count":81},{"name":"80年代","count":2,"total_count":2208},{"name":"英国","count":2,"total_count":755},{"name":"动画电影","count":2,"total_count":43688},{"name":"德国","count":2,"total_count":541},{"name":"1980-1989","count":1,"total_count":308},{"name":"捷克斯洛伐克","count":1,"total_count":149},{"name":"无","count":1,"total_count":1004},{"name":"超可爱","count":1,"total_count":4},{"name":"待看","count":1,"total_count":525},{"name":"Jan.Švankmajer","count":1,"total_count":25},{"name":"long","count":1,"total_count":241},{"name":"Athanor","count":1,"total_count":47},{"name":"爱丽丝","count":1,"total_count":836},{"name":"非日本動畫電影","count":1,"total_count":95},{"name":"85-89","count":1,"total_cou